    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Katagiri-san is very cold&quot; is an RPG game produced by \u30d7\u30e9\u30b9\u30ab\u30bc\u30c3\u30c8 and published by Hanabi games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106490/extras/016a32d26f59ecde4a9188177accde51.avif?t=1732260244\" width=550 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in a dimly lit room, with your classmate Katagiri-san in front of you. Why are you here? Who could've done it? Why is she here? Maybe there is a way to get out of this place... Try to find your way out in this short escape room RPG with hints of horror, comedy, and a bit of spice!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106490/extras/20f533c29caf7fa80b713eb336f4e7e9.avif?t=1732260244\" width=550 height=70 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106490/extras/a0848389030224a75b847fb5f2cd81e3.avif?t=1732260244\" width=550 height=380 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106490/extras/c660d07ed5199fb4e7c2e6d06ae7d539.avif?t=1732260244\" width=550 height=70 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jrpg</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captivating story</p></li></ul>",
